# Red Ward's protection from red removes other red Auras from the creature (CR 702.16c, 704.5m) but not Red Ward
# itself (CR 702.16n: "This effect doesn't remove this Aura"). Bot1's Devoted Hero wears Burrowing (red) first; when
# Red Ward resolves on it, state-based actions put Burrowing into the graveyard and Ward stays. Painter's Servant then
# names red, so Red Ward is itself red (CR 105.3) and still protects from red: it stays.

